    "title": "Delaware County Relay for Life Changing Up 2026 Event - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Janelle Tucker ,\n17 hours ago The Delaware County Relay for Life is back this year – and they’re changing things up. The Relay for Life is a fundraiser for the American Cancer Society that is held every two years in Delaware County. This year, it’s planned for Friday, June 12th. And co-chair Sue McCormac says after nearly 30 years at the fairgrounds, they’re moving the event to downtown Manchester this year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
